<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bonds end firmer in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>Swiss bonds end firmer in quiet trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>1530 GMT - Swiss bonds closed firmer, bouyed by technical factors and German bunds that started the session higher. * June Conf contract up 68 basis points at 117.84 percent * 4-1/2 pct June 2007 bond yields 3.74 pct vs 3.82 pct</p>
</text>
